/S /H3
/T (The main reason people are shifting toward EVs is the clear cost advantage. Charging with electricity is much cheaper than using petrol, and EVs require less maintenance. For riders who travel frequently, this results in significant monthly savings.)
/E (The main reason people are shifting toward EVs is the clear cost advantage. Charging with electricity is much cheaper than using petrol, and EVs require less maintenance. For riders who travel frequently, this results in significant monthly savings.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Concerns around pollution and traffic in urban areas have also influenced people to consider EVs as a cleaner and more convenient choice. Delivery platforms and quick commerce companies have added another push by encouraging their riders to use EVs, as it lowers their operating expenses. )
/E (Concerns around pollution and traffic in urban areas have also influenced people to consider EVs as a cleaner and more convenient choice. Delivery platforms and quick commerce companies have added another push by encouraging their riders to use EVs, as it lowers their operating expenses. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
