222 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Ather Energy was founded on October 21, 2013, at IIT Madras by Tarun Mehta and Swapnil Jain, with the belief that electric mobility in India needed to be rethought from the ground up. Rather than simply replacing petrol engines with electric motors, the founders focused on building intelligent, connected, and high-performance scooters that consumers would choose for their superior experience, not just for subsidies or environmental reasons. This philosophy led Ather to reject low-power, utilitarian EVs and instead launch premium models like the 450 and 450X, which offered features such as strong acceleration, real-time range estimates, navigation, and touchscreen dashboards. Over time, this approach helped Ather build a strong brand among urban and tech-savvy buyers, and through its 450 series and the more mass-market Rizta, the company has grown to capture a 15.5% market share, translating to 183,163 units sold.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
