255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (India remains dominated by internal combustion engine \(ICE\) two-wheelers, which are favoured for their low upfront cost and established ecosystem. Converting buyers from ICE to EV requires overcoming significant barriers related to price sensitivity and infrastructure anxiety. While there is a small group of premium customers who care about technology and smart features, the majority of buyers are extremely value-conscious. For them, the total cost of ownership, day-to-day usability, and running costs matter far more than advanced features or performance upgrades.)
/E (India remains dominated by internal combustion engine \(ICE\) two-wheelers, which are favoured for their low upfront cost and established ecosystem. Converting buyers from ICE to EV requires overcoming significant barriers related to price sensitivity and infrastructure anxiety. While there is a small group of premium customers who care about technology and smart features, the majority of buyers are extremely value-conscious. For them, the total cost of ownership, day-to-day usability, and running costs matter far more than advanced features or performance upgrades.)
