298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The company's manufacturing operations were built around modern assembly lines designed to support precision engineering. Ather established proprietary factories in Tamil Nadu and later planned expansion in Maharashtra. These facilities required significant capital investment and operated with fixed overheads that demanded consistent production volumes to achieve efficiency. These factories played a crucial role in enabling Ather's growth, but also contributed to the high capital intensity that the company continues to manage.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
