358 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (As volume growth failed to accelerate sufficiently to absorb these fixed costs, profitability deteriorated. The company accumulated historical losses year after year. Despite rising revenues, Ather struggled to generate positive cash flows and improve its working capital position. The "growth at all costs" phase successfully built a brand, but it is yet to prove itself to be a financially sustainable business model as it stands at the moment, setting the stage for the challenges that would emerge as the company prepared for public markets.)
/E (As volume growth failed to accelerate sufficiently to absorb these fixed costs, profitability deteriorated. The company accumulated historical losses year after year. Despite rising revenues, Ather struggled to generate positive cash flows and improve its working capital position. The "growth at all costs" phase successfully built a brand, but it is yet to prove itself to be a financially sustainable business model as it stands at the moment, setting the stage for the challenges that would emerge as the company prepared for public markets.)
