/S /P
/E (Ather Energy has never achieved profitability. The company continues to post substantial losses, despite volumes that suggest structural challenges in its business model.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Root causes include unresolved unit economics, where manufacturing costs, warranties, and support services consume gross margins, despite achieving 22% gross profit margins in Q2 FY26. The high fixed cost base of manufacturing facilities, Ather Grid charging networks, and distribution centres requires continuous spending. The debt burden requires ongoing interest servicing, straining the cash position. Substantial R&D and technology investment in software, telematics, and new platforms strains cash flow. And competitive market share wars continue to elevate customer acquisition costs.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
