/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3. Ather collects large volumes of real-time data from every scooter, which is currently used mainly for predictive maintenance, route optimisation, and energy flow management. How else can Ather use this data to meaningfully improve rider experience or reduce operational costs, and what practical steps would be required to implement such models using its existing hardware and cloud infrastructure? What strategies would you suggest to Ather, and how would you implement them?)
